### List services
GET {{base}}/v1/service-register/services HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json


### Register a service
POST {{base}}/v1/service-register HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "My Service",
    "owner": null,
    "modules": [
        {
            "type": "memory",
            "endpoint": "http://localhost:7073/api",
            "access": "public",
            "credentials": null
        }
    ]
}

### Edit a service
PUT {{base}}/v1/service-register/{{service_id}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": "{{service_id}}",
    "name": "My Memory Module",
    "modules": [
        {
            "type": "memory",
            "endpoint": "http://localhost:7073/api",
            "access": "service",
            "credentials": null
        }
    ]
}

### Delete (unregister) a service
DELETE {{base}}/v1/service-register/{{service_id}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
